From 31fefcb5d516da16f1f5b31654dee176833e2ee2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vitaly Lipatov <lav@etersoft.ru>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 13:58:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 25/58] soc: qcom: connect TCL ACPI DSI PHY power and clock
 dependencies

The staged DSI PHY cannot operate with its register window alone: it
needs the correct supply, power domain, interface clock and PLL-output
connections to DISPCC.

Extend the display coordinator with a board-owned PHY regulator
description and staged PHY device. Attach its power and clock
dependencies and retain the PHY provider while its outputs are consumed.
Update the staging helpers and Kconfig dependencies to support this
ordering. This prepares the PHY portion of the graph but does not yet
activate DPU scanout.
---
